        "markdown": "# Lionel Episode Grammar Study 01\n\n## Lionel Thesis Monologue\n\nA transcript-grounded map of one episode's argumentative structure.\n\n**28:35 episode**  \n**7 observed segments**  \n**8 provisional editorial moves**  \n**1 specimen**\n\n`THESIS -> SYSTEM -> PATTERN -> CASE -> CONTEXT -> SYNTHESIS -> ACTION`\n\nObserve first. Compare later. Promote only what repeats."
      }
