        "markdown": "# 📺 Source Episode\n\n**Video:** [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tC6Lcvm2pxw\n\n](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tC6Lcvm2pxw\n\n)**Duration represented by transcript:** approximately 28:35\n\n**Available evidence:** the posted YouTube transcript supplied for this study.\n\n**Observed format:** one continuous Lionel monologue with no obvious guest turn or inserted-media transcript.\n\n**Important limitation:** this graph analyzes the posted transcript. It does not claim frame-by-frame inspection of the video, and the auto-caption text contains duplicated timestamps and transcription errors.\n\nSource basis: ",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
