          "graphId": "lionel-episode-grammar-study-01"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧭 Central Observation\n\nThis episode is best described as a **single-thesis editorial monologue**, not primarily as a media-reaction episode.\n\nLionel's controlling proposition is that **Candace Owens is being reclassified as a Russian agent because she cannot be controlled by the political and institutional systems that normally manage public figures**.\n\nThe rest of the episode expands, illustrates, reframes, and operationalizes that thesis rather than moving among unrelated stories. ",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786052694504,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
