      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-episode-grammar-study-01"
        },
        "markdown": "# 1 · Cold Open and Thesis\n## 0:00–2:40\n\nLionel introduces “the machine,” rejects the Russian-agent characterization, and defines Candace as an “unownable variable.”\n\n**Editorial function:** establish the conflict, name the hidden system, and state the episode's thesis before developing evidence or examples. ",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786052694504,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
