        "markdown": "# 2 · Explains the Smear Mechanism\n## 2:43–5:52\n\nHe describes a rhetorical escalation from **hysterical** to **disloyal** to **Russian agent**, then argues that accusations of foreign loyalty are applied asymmetrically.\n\n**Editorial function:** identify a recurring tactic and present it as a system rather than an isolated insult. ",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786052694504,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
