        },
        "markdown": "# 3 · Extended Case Study\n## 6:00–12:27\n\nThe argument shifts into the Charlie Kirk and TPUSA discussion. Lionel says Candace is challenging a closed institutional narrative and introduces the “widow firewall” as a moral barrier to inquiry.\n\n**Editorial function:** use one complicated controversy as a concrete demonstration of the thesis. ",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
