        "markdown": "# 5 · Synthesis\n## 18:33–22:05\n\nHe returns to the controlling idea: the issue is not Russia itself, but the demonstration that a political “permission structure” can be ignored.\n\n**Editorial function:** compress the case study and contextual material back into the central thesis. ",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
