        "markdown": "# 6 · Prescription and Audience Directive\n## 22:13–27:50\n\nLionel tells viewers to reject the foreign-handler frame, demand consistent evidence, continue asking questions, support independent platforms, and map the boundaries of permitted inquiry.\n\n**Editorial function:** convert interpretation into conduct for the audience. ",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
