        "markdown": "# 7 · Show Outro\n## 27:58–28:35\n\nVictory rhetoric gives way to thanks, subscription reminders, notification instructions, and an invitation to comment.\n\n**Editorial function:** close the argument, reaffirm community, and perform the recurring channel-maintenance ritual. ",
