          "graphId": "lionel-episode-grammar-study-01"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧬 Episode Grammar\n\nThe observed sequence is:\n\n**provocative thesis → define hidden system → identify recurring tactic → develop case study → add historical context → return to thesis → prescribe action → channel outro**\n\nThis is more specific than “political commentary.” It describes the episode as a rhetorical composition with a stable argumentative arc.\n\n**Working label:** `Lionel Thesis Monologue`\n\nThis label remains provisional until compared against more episodes.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786052694504,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study-objects",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Objects Discussed",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -500,
        "y": 340
