      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-episode-grammar-study-01"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧱 Objects Discussed\n\nThese are the **subjects and entities** inside the episode:\n\n- Candace Owens\n- the Russian-agent allegation\n- Russia and Israel\n- Charlie Kirk\n- TPUSA\n- Erica Kirk\n- conservative donor and institutional networks\n- independent media audiences\n\nThese are content objects, not show-segment types. A future graph should model them separately from what Lionel is doing rhetorically.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
