      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-episode-grammar-study-01"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧪 Provisional Lionel Segment Types\n\nDo not promote these to permanent classes yet. They are candidates extracted from this episode:\n\n1. **Lionel States Thesis**\n2. **Lionel Defines the System**\n3. **Lionel Identifies a Pattern**\n4. **Lionel Develops a Case Study**\n5. **Lionel Adds Historical or Cultural Context**\n6. **Lionel Synthesizes**\n7. **Lionel Directs the Audience**\n8. **Lionel Closes the Episode**\n\nA future episode may combine, split, rename, or contradict these categories.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786052694504,
