      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-episode-grammar-study-01"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🚫 Important Absences\n\nThe transcript does **not** clearly show:\n\n- Lionel playing an outside video\n- pausing and resuming source media\n- a separate source clip transcript\n- a guest exchange\n- a question-and-answer section\n- multiple unrelated news topics\n\nTherefore this specimen cannot establish the grammar of a media-reaction episode.\n\nA shared **Video Source** or **Timed Media Segment** primitive may still be useful, but this episode mostly points to timestamped regions of Lionel's own monologue.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786052694504,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study-model",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Emerging Show Model",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -740,
