      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-episode-grammar-study-01"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🔬 Comparison Protocol for Future Episodes\n\nRepeat this exercise for each selected episode:\n\n1. preserve the source URL and transcript\n2. divide the episode into timestamped functional segments\n3. separate content objects from editorial moves\n4. record what is present and what is absent\n5. name provisional segment types without promoting them too early\n6. compare the observed sequence with earlier specimens\n7. promote only recurring, useful structures into the Lionel package\n\nThe next high-value specimen should visibly include outside media so we can compare **Thesis Monologue** against **Media Reaction**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786052694504,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
