        "markdown": "# 📏 Current Confidence\n\n**High confidence**\n- this episode is a continuous single-thesis monologue\n- it has a clear argumentative arc\n- the distinction between content objects and editorial moves is useful\n\n**Medium confidence**\n- the eight provisional editorial moves are reusable\n\n**Low confidence**\n- they are stable Lionel node classes\n- this episode represents the overall show\n- a media-reaction format uses the same composition\n\nThis graph is a specimen record, not a finalized template.",
